# nuvo
===
 The local-first music player for Linux, Windows and macOS. Plays YouTube, SoundCloud and your own files, with Scene visuals drawn to the beat, clip export, synced lyrics and a ten-band equalizer. No account and no Nuvo server: your library stays on your machine. Free and open source..
